        <p source="#source-36235-36279"><seg source="#source-36235-36253">こゝに夢あり</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-36253-36271"><rb>眠</rb><rt>ねむり</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-36271-36279">あり</seg></p>
