        <p source="#source-38287-38334"><seg source="#source-38287-38302">今はた残る</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-38302-38329"><rb>歌反古</rb><rt>うたほご</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-38329-38334">の</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-38334-38383"><seg source="#source-38334-38343">ながき</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-38343-38358"><rb>愁</rb><rt>うれ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-38358-38383">ひをいかにせむ</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-38383-38430"><seg source="#source-38383-38410">かなしいかなやする</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-38410-38425"><rb>墨</rb><rt>すみ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-38425-38430">の</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-38430-38465"><seg source="#source-38430-38465">いろに染めてし花の木の</seg></p>
