        <p source="#source-38497-38528"><seg source="#source-38497-38528">薄き命のひゞきあり</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-38528-38575"><seg source="#source-38528-38549">かなしいかなや</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-38549-38564"><rb>前</rb><rt>さき</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-38564-38575">の世は</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-38575-38610"><seg source="#source-38575-38610">みそらにかゝる星の身の</seg></p>
