        <p source="#source-39988-40035"><seg source="#source-39988-40009">きづなも捨てて</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-40009-40027"><rb>嘶</rb><rt>いなな</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-40027-40035">けば</seg></p>
