        <p source="#source-40366-40419"><seg source="#source-40366-40372">力を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-40372-40387"><rb>刻</rb><rt>きざ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-40387-40390">む</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-40390-40414"><rb>木匠</rb><rt>こだくみ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-40414-40419">の</seg></p>
