        <p source="#source-60056-60091"><seg source="#source-60056-60091">をとこの黒き目のいろの</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-60091-60120"><seg source="#source-60091-60120">お夏の胸に映るとき</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-60120-60179"><seg source="#source-60120-60132">をとこの</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-60132-60147"><rb>紅</rb><rt>あか</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-60147-60150">き</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-60150-60174"><rb>口唇</rb><rt>くちびる</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-60174-60179">の</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-60179-60213"><seg source="#source-60179-60213">お夏の口にもゆるとき</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-60213-60257"><seg source="#source-60213-60231">人こそしらね</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-60231-60249"><rb>嗚呼</rb><rt>ああ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-60249-60257">恋の</seg></p>
