        <p source="#source-60751-60780"><seg source="#source-60751-60780">星の光を眼に見ては</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-60780-60830"><seg source="#source-60780-60801">身にふりかゝる</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-60801-60825"><rb>凶禍</rb><rt>まがごと</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-60825-60830">の</seg></p>
