        <p source="#source-61269-61331"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-61269-61293"><rb>九十九</rb><rt>つくも</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-61293-61296">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-61296-61314"><rb>翁</rb><rt>おきな</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-61314-61331">うつし世の</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-61331-61363"><seg source="#source-61331-61363">こゝろの慾の夢を恋ひ</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-61363-61422"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-61363-61375"><rb>音</rb><rt>ね</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-61375-61393">をだにきかぬ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-61393-61417"><rb>雛鶴</rb><rt>ひなづる</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-61417-61422">の</seg></p>
