        <p source="#source-61616-61663"><seg source="#source-61616-61634">春さきかへる</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-61634-61658"><rb>夏花</rb><rt>なつはな</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-61658-61663">や</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-61663-61710"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-61663-61678"><rb>是</rb><rt>これ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-61678-61710">わざはひにあらずして</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-61710-61757"><seg source="#source-61710-61719">よしや</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-61719-61737"><rb>兆</rb><rt>しるし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-61737-61757">といへるあり</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-61757-61807"><seg source="#source-61757-61778">なにを酔ひ鳴く</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-61778-61802"><rb>春鳥</rb><rt>はるどり</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-61802-61807">よ</seg></p>
