        <p source="#source-62003-62047"><seg source="#source-62003-62018">世を傾けむ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-62018-62042"><rb>麗人</rb><rt>よきひと</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-62042-62047">の</seg></p>
