        <p source="#source-62881-62931"><seg source="#source-62881-62887">あな</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-62887-62911"><rb>天雲</rb><rt>あまぐも</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-62911-62931">にともなはれ</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-62931-62960"><seg source="#source-62931-62960">緑の髪をうちふるひ</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-62960-63001"><seg source="#source-62960-62975">雄馬は人に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-62975-62993"><rb>随</rb><rt>したが</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-62993-63001">ひて</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-63001-63054"><seg source="#source-63001-63010">箱根の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-63010-63025"><rb>嶺</rb><rt>みね</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-63025-63028">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-63028-63043"><rb>下</rb><rt>くだ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-63043-63054">りけり</seg></p>
