        <p source="#source-63163-63222"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-63163-63178"><rb>喉</rb><rt>のど</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-63178-63193">はよせくる</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-63193-63217"><rb>春濤</rb><rt>はるなみ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-63217-63222">を</seg></p>
