        <p source="#source-63266-63298"><seg source="#source-63266-63298">目はひさかたの朝の星</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-63298-63357"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-63298-63319"><rb>睫毛</rb><rt>まつげ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-63319-63328">は草の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-63328-63355"><rb>浅緑</rb><rt>あさみどり</rt></ruby></p>
        <p source="#source-63357-63404"><seg source="#source-63357-63375">うるほひ光る</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-63375-63396"><rb>眼瞳</rb><rt>ひとみ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-63396-63404">には</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-63404-63463"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-63404-63425"><rb>千里</rb><rt>ちさと</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-63425-63428">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-63428-63443"><rb>外</rb><rt>ほか</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-63443-63463">もほがらにて</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-63463-63492"><seg source="#source-63463-63492">東に照らし西に入る</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-63492-63524"><seg source="#source-63492-63524">天つみそらを渡る日の</seg></p>
